    "Name": "M.A.S.H Truck",
    "Details": "A lightly armored vehicle, the MASH Truck is not designed for combat. Equipped with a pair of Anti-Missile Systems, the MASH Truck is considered to be neutral, with most combatants going out of their way to avoid targeting or attacking the Truck. With it’s onboard array of medical equipment, the MASH can perform everything from basic triage all the way up to life saving surgery; as the situation demands.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 5/8 hexes / 150/240 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        60     10\n<b>Left</b>          75     10\n<b>Right</b>        75     10\n<b>Rear</b>         50     10\n<b>Turret</b>       45     10\n\n<b>Total</b>      305     50</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
